"review": "one of the best action roguelite games ever created, especially co-op!\n\nhighlights:\n- easy upgrade/shopping system though allowing limitless builds/runs (pure gun/ melee/ grenade/ turrets etc.)\n- vibrant ever-colorful environments\n- bumping soundtrack (he's electronic music producer)\n- good difficulty options with Nightmare + modifiers\n- end a room with 100+ chests in a line crossing the entire map and over and you can't get them except click auto-loot but then you need to throw away ones you don't want in your build\n- starfish with cute sound giving you surprise\n\nlowlights: \n- none if you don't dislike crabs and their families\n- starfish with cute sound giving you jumpscare heart attack\n\nFACT: Crabs can move forward faster than sideways, sometimes jump across the room\n\nbig up to the developer bringing updates to this game every so often, always fun to revisit with new stuff to play.\nalso this is one of the those video games that you know you won when it starts to lag >:D", "timestamp_created": 1750588671, "timestamp_updated": 1750588671, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}]}